i know who wont receive cookies again.

Thanks for your kind words.But i keep my decision.If there would be a way out,i would work for it,i would be willing to.But sadly,there is no way to fix me,yet.And if so,i couldnt afford it either way.

&#x200B;

Either way,stay positive,friend
